From 9c9a1d81ec6bfe57e9cc6cc2a90a0e8929f3b25f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fabiantorrestech <fabiantorrestech@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 08:34:11 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Drawer: show apps only after search (inkOS-Patcher)

Adds Settings > App Drawer > Search > "Show Apps" with three modes:
- Always: vanilla behavior.
- While typing: the drawer is empty until the search box has text.
- After Search key (default): the drawer is empty until Search is
  pressed for the current text. Editing the text hides results again;
  a second Search press launches the first result.

Only the normal drawer is gated, and only while the search bar is on.
Hidden apps, home-app picking, favorites editing and the AZ filter are
unchanged. Rules live in ui/DrawerReveal.kt; upstream files get small
hooks only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
